<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $1.00 lower; butts not fully established; skinned hams 17-20 lbs 1.00 higher in light test, 20-26 lbs unevenly steady; seedless bellies mostly steady; lean trimmings steady to 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light demand and generally moderate offerings. -USDA</p>
